<title>USA: Firstar says to buy back common stock.</title>
<headline>Firstar says to buy back common stock.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firstar Corp said its board approved the repurchase of Firstar common stock worth up to $150 million.</p>
<p>Repurchases will be made in the open market or in privately negotiated transactions from time to time, said the financial services company.</p>
<p>Firstar said it expects to fund the repurchase program with proceeds from a private sale of $150 million in Capital Securities to be issued by Firstar Capital Trust I, a statutory business trust sponsored by Firstar.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
